Subject: [PATCH] mapd: enforce SAE backhaul policy and query negotiated peer AKM

Reject incompatible enrolled profiles under validated SAE policy without
changing vendor shared structures. Keep legacy policy behavior, but never
downgrade a pure SAE profile. Add a fixed read-only query of associated
APCLI peer AKM/cipher using the existing pinned driver station-table ioctl.

--- a/src/apSelection/apSelection.c
+++ b/src/apSelection/apSelection.c
@@ -1502,27 +1502,32 @@
 *
 * @return 0 if success else error
 */
+/* procd validates this policy; no fields are added to shared vendor structs. */
+static int mesh_bh_profile_allowed(unsigned short auth)
+{
+	const char *policy = getenv("AX6000_MESH_BACKHAUL_SECURITY");
+	return !policy || !strcmp(policy, "psk2") ||
+		(!strcmp(policy, "sae") && auth == WSC_AUTHTYPE_SAE);
+}
